踢腿的保镖，脚直接踹在了自己同伴的手臂上，踢断了那人的手肘关节！林飞把那断手的保镖一拉扯，就跟一个链球一样，又冲着那踢人的保镖身上甩了过去！“啊呀！”两名保镖撞在一起，吃痛地大喊，全都摔倒在地。侯雷和剩下的两个保镖都不敢置信，两名一百七八十斤的汉子竟然跟玩具一样，被这出租车司机扔在了地上！苏映雪也睁大了美眸，一眨不眨地看着林飞。侯雷身边另外两名保镖再度站出来，想要对林飞动手，可已经被侯雷直接拦住。“你们不是他对手，我亲自来”。侯雷沉声说着，将西装外套一脱扔地上，捏了捏拳头。“小子，你的身手不错，但可惜你遇见了我”。说完，侯雷就如猛虎下山一般，朝着林飞起身一个旋踢，劈山裂石般脚跟重重砸向林飞的肩膀。林飞轻轻地一闪避，侯雷的腿扫了一个空，直接刮起一道猛烈的气流，让后面的苏映雪都吓得花容失色。侯雷一击不成，又是连续朝着林飞腾空两下踢腿，全都被林飞用手掌“啪啪”地连着挡了下来。看脚攻不成，侯雷的拳头又纷至沓来，每一拳的速度和力量都胜过刚才那两个保镖一倍有余。“呼呼”声中，拳头快地让人肉眼都不太看得清，全都朝着林飞的脑门砸去！可不知道为什么，林飞总是早一步地就避开他的攻击，而且脚步并没怎么大范围移动，一直在原地游走。“海军陆战队的格斗技巧，上过战场的煞气，一个曾经的铁汉，现在却沦落到当走狗欺负一个女人么”。林飞轻描淡写地说。侯雷的是身影一顿，脸色涨红，林飞的话仿佛是一根刺，狠狠戳在了他的自尊心上。“哼！你懂什么！当过兵，流过血的人，才知道活着不是那么容易的！！一个女人，早晚都是嫁出去，嫁给一个男人就能缓解公司危机，给家族带来十几亿的资金，有什么大不了的！？”林飞点点头，“确实不容易，但人生在世，不是为了‘容易’二字，活一辈子的。”“放屁！闭嘴！！”侯雷怒吼一声，一记拳头汇聚全身的力气，朝着林飞胸膛轰去！林飞的身影忽然一矮，手轻轻在侯雷的手腕上一搭，不知怎的往下这么一翻后，侯雷整个冲过来的身体，顺势一个凌空翻腾！“砰！”侯雷的身体沉沉地腾空翻滚着落到青石路面上。所有人都鸦雀无声，但都清楚，侯雷完败了！“侯哥！”几个保镖赶紧上去把侯雷搀扶起来，才发现侯雷已经摔得鼻青脸肿，嘴角还磕出了血。侯雷不要别人搀扶，甩开几个手下，阴森地看着林飞。“我不是你的对手，但你不要以为，打赢了我，就没事了。英雄救美只是说书人说说的，你会为此付出代价，你就等着老爷和青马集团的人把你弄死吧！”林飞无所谓地道：“我既然出手，就有心理准备，倒是你，去一趟医院吧，你的肋骨应该断了两根。”侯雷忍着剧痛，咬牙道：“不用你多嘴！”说完，又看了苏映雪一眼，带人转身开车离开。苏映雪看着两辆奔驰车开走，感到全身的力气像是泄空了一般，看着一脸从容的林飞，眼里有些复杂，心里更是不知道什么滋味。“不要以为打跑他们，我就会放过你，我让你走的，是你自己多管闲事”，苏映雪别过头，冷漠地道。嘴边那散不去的烟草味，提醒她之前发生的噩梦。林飞压根没太当回事，对这女人的死板脾气倒再度领略了回。“我也没让你谢我，只是顺手解决点看不惯的事。不过苏小姐最好还是叫一些忠心的保镖护着你，不然还是会有麻烦”。“不用你提醒”，苏映雪也后悔低估了这些人的胆量，竟然敢做到这种地步，自己确实不能掉以轻心，该自己去联系保镖公司了。林飞耸了耸肩，打算就此离开，可苏映雪却喊住了他。“喂，你等下”。林飞回头，哭笑不得，“苏小姐，你该不会真要报警让警察来抓我吧？”苏映雪抿了抿薄唇，说道：“我还在考虑，你有帮我，但你同时也做了让我无法原谅的事，等我想好以后，会告诉你我的决定。”林飞正色道：“只要你仔细想想，应该就能明白，我从头到尾都没想过伤害你，一切都是事出无奈。”“一码归一码，你帮我，和你伤害我，是两件事”，苏映雪坚持道：“你把电话和地址写给我，得出结果后，我会联系你，别想着逃跑，不要怀疑我跟警方的关系。”“这对你有什么好处？昨晚发生的事难道很光彩？闹得警方法院都知道，不觉得损害你名誉么？”林飞觉得不可理喻。苏映雪一听，眼里蒙上了一层水雾，冷笑道：“不要以为用‘名誉’两个字就能吓住我，我才不会怕那些风言风语。”林飞无语，看来这女人有些死脑筋，长得跟仙女似的，怎么性格和茅坑里的石头般又臭又硬。懒得多费唇舌，林飞把自己的电话地址报给了苏映雪，然后手朝着苏映雪一伸。苏映雪黛眉轻蹙，看着伸来的手，“你要什么？”林飞一脸不爽地道：“难道苏小姐不知道，坐出租车是收费的？”“你……”苏映雪咬着银牙，明知道这家伙是气自己，但坐出租付钱天经地义，但她身上没钱，只好走回家一趟取了几张一百的，出来直接塞到林飞手上。“不用找了，留下的钱买点好吃的，牢饭可不好吃”，苏映雪美眸狠狠剜了林飞一眼，转身走回家。林飞目光追着女人袅娜的背影，一直到她进屋，仿佛和记忆中的那抹倩影仿佛重叠在一起，可两个人的性格，又如此的不同。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/nuzongcaideshenjibaobiao/7.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 0007 The prison food is not good. I saw that the bodyguard's fist had been lightly pinched by Lin Fei's left hand, and he was frozen in the air. It seemed that he wanted to hit but couldn't, and couldn't take it back. Su Yingxue suddenly thought that if Lin Fei didn't have some skills, he might not have successfully rescued her last night, but she didn't expect that he would be so strong with such a figure. The bodyguard blushed and tried to push his fist over, but he found that Lin Fei's left hand was like a steel bar, locking his fist firmly. \"Do you want to continue?\" Lin Fei asked. Another bodyguard shouted, rushed forward and gave Lin Fei a long and fierce kick in the stomach! Lin Fei suddenly pulled the fist he held in his left hand toward his abdomen! \"Uh-huh!!\" The kicking bodyguard kicked his companion's arm directly, breaking the man's elbow joint! Lin Fei pulled the bodyguard with the severed hand and threw it at the kicking bodyguard like a hammer! \"Ah!\" The two bodyguards collided with each other, yelling in pain, and they both fell to the ground. Hou Lei and the remaining two bodyguards couldn't believe it. Two men weighing 1,780 pounds were thrown to the ground like toys by the taxi driver! Su Yingxue also opened her beautiful eyes wide and looked at Lin Fei without blinking. The other two bodyguards around Hou Lei stood up again and wanted to attack Lin Fei, but they were directly stopped by Hou Lei. \"You are no match for him, I will do it myself.\" Hou Lei said in a deep voice, took off his suit jacket, threw it to the ground, and clenched his fists. \"Boy, you have good skills, but it's a pity that you met me.\" After saying that, Hou Lei was like a tiger descending the mountain, he stood up and kicked Lin Fei with a spinning kick, and hit Lin Fei's shoulder with his heel like splitting mountains and rocks. Lin Fei dodged lightly, and Hou Lei's leg swept away, directly blowing up a violent airflow, which made Su Yingxue behind him turn pale with fear. Hou Lei failed to hit the target and kicked Lin Fei twice in succession, but Lin Fei blocked them all with his palms. Seeing that the kick attack failed, Hou Lei's fists came one after another. The speed and power of each punch were more than twice that of the two bodyguards just now. In the sound of \"whoosh\", the fists were so fast that it was hard to see clearly with the naked eye, and they all hit Lin Fei's head! But for some reason, Lin Fei always avoided his attacks one step ahead, and his footsteps didn't move much in a wide range, and kept wandering in place. \"The fighting skills of the Marine Corps, the evil spirit of having been on the battlefield, a once strong man, but now he is reduced to being a lackey to bully a woman.\" Lin Fei said lightly. Hou Lei's figure paused and his face turned red. Lin Fei's words seemed like a thorn in his self-esteem. \"Hmph! What do you know! Only those who have been in the military and shed blood know that life is not that easy!! A woman will get married sooner or later. Marrying a man can alleviate the company's crisis and bring billions of dollars to the family. What's the big deal? \"Yes!\" Lin Fei nodded, \"It's not easy, but life is not for the word 'easy'.\" \"Shut up!\" Hou Lei roared, gathering all his strength and hitting Lin Fei's chest! Lin Fei's figure suddenly dwarfed, and he gently put his hand on Hou Lei's wrist. Somehow, after turning down like this, Hou Lei's whole rushing body started to flip in the air! \"Bang!\" Hou Lei's body rolled heavily into the air and landed on the bluestone pavement. Everyone was silent, but they all knew that Hou Lei was completely defeated! \"Brother Hou!\" Several bodyguards rushed up to help Hou Lei up, only to find that Hou Lei had been bruised and swollen from the fall, and blood was bleeding from the corner of his mouth. Hou Lei didn't want anyone to help him, so he threw away a few of his men and looked at Lin Fei gloomily. \"I'm not your opponent, but don't think that if you defeat me, everything will be fine. Heroes saving beauties is just what storytellers say. You will pay the price for it. Just wait for the master and the people of Qingma Group to kill you!\" Lin Fei said nonchalantly: \"Since I took action, I was mentally prepared. But you, please go to the hospital. You should have two broken ribs.\" Hou Lei endured the severe pain and gritted his teeth and said, \"You don't need to say anything!\" After saying that, he looked at Su Yingxue again, turned around and drove away. Su Yingxue watched the two Mercedes-Benz cars drive away, feeling as if all her strength had been drained. She looked at Lin Fei with a calm face, her eyes were a little complicated, and she didn't know what to feel in her heart. \"Don't think that if you beat them away, I will let you go. I let you go because you are meddling in your own business.\" Su Yingxue looked away and said coldly. The lingering smell of tobacco on her lips reminded her of the nightmare that had happened before. Lin Fei didn't take it seriously at all, but he came to appreciate this woman's rigid temper again. \"I didn't ask you to thank me, I just solved some unpleasant things. But Miss Su had better ask some loyal bodyguards to protect you, otherwise you will still be in trouble.\" \"You don't need to remind me.\" Su Yingxue also regretted that she underestimated the courage of these people and dared to do this. She really couldn't take it lightly. It was time to contact the bodyguard company herself. Lin Fei shrugged and was about to leave, but Su Yingxue stopped him. \"Hey, wait a minute.\" Lin Fei turned around, dumbfounded, \"Miss Su, are you really going to call the police and ask the police to arrest me?\" Su Yingxue pursed her thin lips and said, \"I'm still thinking about it. You helped me, but you also did something I can't forgive. After I think about it, I will tell you my decision.\" Lin Fei said seriously: \"Just If you think about it carefully, you should be able to understand that I never thought of hurting you from the beginning to the end. Everything happened out of necessity. \"\"One code, one code, you helping me and you hurting me are two different things.\" Su Yingxue insisted: \"Write me your phone number and address. I will contact you after I get the result. Don't think about running away, no.", "title_en": "Chapter 7"}